    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When toilet signs are harder to decipher than Morse codes, your bladder is the last compass! You'll play as the Reborn and complete the most modest survival challenge in an infinitely looping toilet maze \u2013 finding a door that allows your gender to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each start randomly receives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >period:Tramp in office/Biiden in office</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >chromosome:from xxxxxxxx to yyyyyyyy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gender identity:97 Official Options + Memes(gunship/wallmart bag/Hideyoshi...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what's new:self-recognition as a monkey/determined to be the\u00a0great Cthulhu...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confusing toilet signage system that keeps pace with the times</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right door to enter, and if not, turn back immediately \u2013 just like all other anomaly games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fictional work is not inspired by historical events and characters, and is designed, developed, and produced by a culturally limited team of members of unknown beliefs, sexualities, and genders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters, locations and elements involved in the game are purely fictitious and any similarities are coincidental.</p>",
